      Data: Cornelius4
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: However, your arrival here at this exact moment should not be considered
        coincidental. A newcomer with a knack for tinkering, and an ancient mechanical
        helper whose purpose is to maintain the <style=Engine>sky engines</style>
        are exactly what's required!
    - Name: <LocalizedKey>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: LOCAL_DIALOG_KEY
    - Name: <Choices>k__BackingField
