      Data: Cornelius5
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: In fact, it appears your helper has already acquired the first piece
        of this mysterious puzzle on its own. An ancient artifact that will stabilize
        the <style=Engine>sky engine</style>, preventing further chaos.
