      Data: Cornelius7
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: I knew you'd say that, very well. Installing this artifact is the first
        step to survival, which I shall leave to you as the tinkerer. It may appear
        dangerous, but entrust that the <style=Engine>sky engine</style> will keep
        you safe as long as the islands stay afloat.
