    - Name: <Name>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: Cornelius22
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: Though we have lost the means to traverse it, an ancient rail network
        still exists. A rather eclectic inventor by the name of Sponglefritz lives
        among the maple trees. He may offer a solution. Seek him out with haste,
        yes?
    - Name: <LocalizedKey>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: LOCAL_DIALOG_KEY
    - Name: <Choices>k__BackingField
      Entry: 7
